WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.086
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:26.942
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:30.573
will recommend a feasible option explain the consequence and

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:35.823
identify what remains unconfirmed Outcomes linked to this activity

00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:40.573
EA-01 . 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities from those of

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.349
a personal assistant office manager chief of staff and

00:00:44.455 --> 00:00:48.547
specialist adviser and refer work outside the agreed mandate

00:00:49.521 --> 00:00:54.402
EA-01 . 4 Present options and consequences when demands

00:00:54.455 --> 00:00:59.797
compete including effects on preparation time cost wellbeing and

00:00:59.876 --> 00:01:05.006
required protective decisions Learning practice and acknowledgement are not

00:01:05.059 --> 00:01:07.874
an assessor result or workplace authorisation
